# This repository does NOT use Git LFS. The JSON under data/ is committed as
# ordinary blobs.
#
# Do not add `filter=lfs` rules here on their own. Routing a path to LFS while
# its committed blobs are still plain content makes every one of those files
# show up as modified in a clean clone: the working copy gets clean-filtered
# into a pointer and compared against the real blob. A contributor cloning the
# repo then sees hundreds of files they never touched.
#
# If LFS is wanted, it takes a deliberate migration (`git lfs migrate import`)
# that rewrites history, plus a force-push and a heads-up to anyone holding a
# fork — not a rule added here.
